    "agendaChanges": "The board approved two resequencing changes at the start of the meeting: (1) Section 9 (School/Community Reports) was moved to immediately after Section 7 (Approval of Agenda), before Section 8 (Oral Communication); (2) Consent Item 10.19 (Approval of Student Instructional Calendars) was pulled from the consent calendar and moved to Action Items under Section 11. As a result, the actual order was: Call to Order/Roll Call, Changes to Agenda, Approval of Agenda, Report Out on Closed Session, Section 9 (School/Community Reports), then Oral Communication (Section 8 - Citizen Presentation on Bond Program), then Consent Items (Section 10 minus 10.19), then Action Items (Section 11, including pulled 10.19), then Board/Superintendent Reports, Information, Correspondence, Other Business, Calendar, Adjournment. Section 5 (Welcome) and Section 4 Roll Call were effectively combined with the opening. The president also noted the report out on closed session was handled informally at the start.",
